// Supervisor (suggest) + D-071: on an `uncertain` verdict, ask the agent once per task to check
// the items the evidence does not show, as SWE-agent's submit review and OpenHands' critic
// follow-up do. It costs a continuation, so read turns and wall-clock beside success. Compare
